40
00:03:33,380 --> 00:03:34,350
Wan'er...

41
00:03:39,140 --> 00:03:40,550
I hate you !!!

42
00:03:41,540 --> 00:03:43,710
I never believed in fate !

43
00:03:44,370 --> 00:03:45,480
She's already gone.

44
00:03:45,250 --> 00:03:46,760
I told you not to tell her.

45
00:03:46,510 --> 00:03:47,580
It's all your fault !

46
00:03:48,030 --> 00:03:49,380
You... You...

47
00:03:50,340 --> 00:03:51,310
Enough !

48
00:03:53,340 --> 00:03:55,710
If I were to get lost in this emotionless domain,

49
00:03:56,540 --> 00:03:57,870
