50
00:03:58,460 --> 00:04:00,790
I would become an emotionless murderer.

51
00:04:01,780 --> 00:04:03,990
Life and death are controlled by her thoughts.

52
00:04:04,460 --> 00:04:05,690
Her domain

53
00:04:05,500 --> 00:04:07,490
