222
00:15:12,900 --> 00:15:15,750
You cannot be scared of mere Celestial Beast Feed.

223
00:15:16,460 --> 00:15:19,170
How are you going to be respected in the Da Lou Sword Sect ?

224
00:15:19,220 --> 00:15:21,540
If we can catch that Celestial Beast Feed,

225
00:15:21,580 --> 00:15:23,650
