252
00:17:25,700 --> 00:17:28,460
Obtaining a celestial artifact is an unprecedented opportunity.

253
00:17:28,340 --> 00:17:30,870
While the Celestial Beast Feeds are running rampant,

254
00:17:30,900 --> 00:17:33,390
